# ACHIEVER Site Administration — public build-time values ONLY (visible in the bundle).
# No Supabase, Paystack, Resend, Termii, LiveKit or JWT secrets belong here: the admin
# app talks only to the ACHIEVER API, which holds every secret.

# Leave EMPTY (recommended): the admin host forwards /api to the API (vercel.json), so the
# admin session cookie is first-party. Otherwise the API's URL; must match ADMIN_API_PUBLIC_URL.
VITE_ADMIN_API_URL=
